   212	  environment, allocation counters, heap, stack, return state, exception
   213	  state, and exit code.
   214	- **A3:** lookup, argument order, indexing, frame control, short-circuiting,
   215	  and return unwinding all execute under the supplied semantics.
   216	- **A4:** all proof-local equations are truthful on their complete domains;
   217	  total equations have exhaustive, non-overlapping coverage.
   218	- **A5:** `03-11-2000` is a realizable witness. The false-result mutation was
