   226	  supplied semantics. Character positions are modeled as integer code points;
   227	  the implementation deliberately recognizes ASCII digits, the conventional
   228	  meaning of the literal `mm-dd-yyyy` format.
   229	- **B3:** `validDateResult` directly states separator, digit, month, and day
   230	  constraints rather than merely naming an opaque execution result.
   231	- **B4:** the implementation, formal property, prompt examples, and stated
