   248	- **`py2mpy.py` and CPython AST parsing:** supplied and unmodified. They connect
   249	  `solution.py` to `solution.mpy`; the generation command and parsed-KORE
   250	  identity check provide reproducible evidence.
   251	- **K toolchain, Haskell backend, SMT reasoning, and LLVM backend:** trusted
   252	  proof/execution infrastructure. Version observed:
